{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53742","headline":"船子和尚东游泊钓船处 · 愚公谷人","name":"船子和尚东游泊钓船处","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"和尚东来泊钓船，一溪秋水月明天。\n此中定有高人出，爲忆前身几百年。\n（《续机缘集》卷上）（按：清嘉庆六年三月二十七日，法忍寺天空阁毁於火，於灰烬中得小碣，中刻此诗，後勒会昌元年十一月款，书愚公谷人记。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"愚公谷人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53742.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53742","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}